  tmtheme.xml is loaded automatically for it (yazi-config/src/theme/flavor.rs
  resolves flavors/<name>.yazi/tmtheme.xml). Before 2026-08-18 we shipped no
  tmTheme at all, so every file preview was highlighted in syntect's stock
  palette while the rest of the UI followed the theme — the one part of yazi
  that never matched anything else on screen.

  Scope selection is deliberately broad rather than language-specific: the
  palette only has the sixteen ANSI slots plus the surface/text ramp to spend,
  so the mapping is the conventional one (strings green, keywords magenta,
